2","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":true,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":true,"retention_period":730,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3557630,"location":{"name":"Dublin, Ireland"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8220192,"updated_at":"2026-09-22T06:31:19-04:00","requisition_id":"P24808_3557630","title":"Associate Solutions Engineer, Auth0","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-09-21T11:05:56-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Solutions Engineers (SEs) at Okta play a pivotal role in the customer journey, helping organizations solve complex identity challenges. We engage with customers at every stage, combining our technical curiosity with business insight to drive meaningful conversations. We’re looking for team players who can create impactful sales presentations, build compelling product demonstrations, and educate a wide audience on modern cloud security solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a strong background in technology, a mindset of continuous learning, and a passion for customer engagement, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customers throughout the sales journey (discovery, validation, proposal, due diligence), demonstrating the value of Auth0 through live demos and presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate directly with developers, product managers, and occasionally senior executives across various industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the sales team as the go-to technical counterpart, enabling customers to validate the value and potential of the Auth0 platform.&lt;/li&gt;
