&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;The Okta Commercial Sales Team drives the adoption of workforce and customer identity solutions across high-growth accounts. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional partners, including Solutions Engineering, Business Development, Partner Alliances, and Customer Success. The role reports directly to the Regional Sales Director for Commercial Accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;As a Commercial Account Executive, you will lead full-cycle sales engagements to expand Okta&#39;s market footprint across assigned commercial territories in Australia. You will act as a trusted advisor to C-suite and senior IT/Security stakeholders, helping organizations secure their digital transformation initiatives. This role offers an exceptional opportunity to drive high-impact deals in a fast-paced, growth-oriented market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive territory account plans to generate high-quality pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,1,0&quot;&gt;Manage full-cycle sales engagements from initial discovery through contract negotiation and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,2,0&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strategic relationships with C-level executives, IT directors, and security leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,3,0&quot;&gt;Present compelling business cases and product demonstrations aligned with customer business priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,4,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with channel partners and system integrators to maximize market coverage and deal velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,5,0&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate sales forecasting and operational discipline within CRM tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;22,6,0&quot;&gt;Travel within the region as needed to conduct executive briefings and client workshops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,0,0&quot;&gt;5+ years of related sales experience in a professional role with a Bachelor’s degree; or 3+ years with a Master’s degree; or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,1,0&quot;&gt;Proven success managing and closing B2B SaaS or cybersecurity sales cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,2,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate multi-stakeholder deals and establish trust with senior executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,3,0&quot;&gt;Experience utilizing value-based selling methodologies such as MEDDPICC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,4,0&quot;&gt;Strong negotiation, strategic planning, and presentation capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;24,5,0&quot;&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills across technical and business audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
