&lt;p data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;Okta’s vision is to free everyone to safely use any technology, anywhere. We provide a secure, highly available, enterprise-grade platform that protects billions of workforce logins each year. As an Okta AE, you will drive territory growth across India—acquiring new commercial / mid-market customers while also strengthening and expanding relationships with existing customers through upsell and cross-sell opportunities. With the support of your Okta ecosystem, you’ll deliver consistent results with an unwavering commitment to customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;871&quot;&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;872&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and experienced Commercial / Mid-Market Account Executive who is passionate about security, identity, and building long-term partnerships with customers in India. You will be responsible for both new business acquisition and account expansion, enabling India’s mid-market organizations to modernize their identity strategy with Okta.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1260&quot; data-end=&quot;1286&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1287&quot; data-end=&quot;2557&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1287&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;Pipeline Generation &amp;amp; New Business: Establish a vision and plan to consistently build new pipeline across commercial / mid-market accounts in India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1287&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1289&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;Territory Growth: Consistently achieve revenue targets through both net new logos and expansion of existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Upsell &amp;amp; Cross-sell: Drive growth within existing accounts by identifying opportunities to expand Okta’s footprint across workforce identity, customer identity, and adjacent use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1764&quot; data-end=&quot;1906&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1766&quot; data-end=&quot;1906&quot;&gt;C-Suite Engagement: Position Okta’s value with senior executives, articulating how we secure their workforce, customers, and partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1907&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2032&quot;&gt;Account Strategy: Identify, develop, and execute account strategies that deliver repeatable and predictable bookings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2033&quot; data-end=&quot;2185&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2035&quot; data-end=&quot;2185&quot;&gt;Partnerships: Leverage GSIs, regional SIs, and the broader partner ecosystem in India to open new opportunities and expand existing engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2186&quot; data-end=&quot;2343&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2188&quot; data-end=&quot;2343&quot;&gt;Collaboration: Work closely with Okta’s ecosystem (SDRs, partners, presales, customer success, etc.) to maximize account coverage and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2344&quot; data-end=&quot;2470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2346&quot; data-end=&quot;2470&quot;&gt;Value-Based Selling: Adopt a consultative approach, bringing a compelling point of view to each customer conversation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2471&quot; data-end=&quot;2557&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2473&quot; data-end=&quot;2557&quot;&gt;Travel: Meet with customers, prospects, and partners across India as required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2564&quot; data-end=&quot;2599&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring to the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2600&quot; data-end=&quot;3514&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2600&quot; data-end=&quot;2736&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2736&quot;&gt;5+ years of success selling complex SaaS solutions, ideally in security, identity, or adjacent technologies in the India market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2737&quot; data-end=&quot;2879&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2739&quot; data-end=&quot;2879&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to grow commercial / mid-market accounts through upselling and cross-selling, as well as acquiring new customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2880&quot; data-end=&quot;3005&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2882&quot; data-end=&quot;3005&quot;&gt;Strong track record selling into the C-suite and senior decision makers across commercial / mid-market organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3006&quot; data-end=&quot;3106&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3008&quot; data-end=&quot;3106&quot;&gt;Experience working closely with GSIs and regional SIs in India to drive joint opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3107&quot; data-end=&quot;3213&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3109&quot; data-end=&quot;3213&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and negotiation skills across technical and business audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3214&quot; data-end=&quot;3313&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3216&quot; data-end=&quot;3313&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles with predictable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3314&quot; data-end=&quot;3423&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3316&quot; data-end=&quot;3423&quot;&gt;Familiarity with MEDDPICC, Challenger, or other value-based sales methodologies (Okta uses MEDDPICC).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3424&quot; data-end=&quot;3514&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3426&quot; data-end=&quot;3514&quot;&gt;Self-driven, confident, and adaptable, with the humility to work effectively in teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
