&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":28535,"name":"Customer Support-740","child_ids":[],"parent_id":396313}],"offices":[{"id":89126,"name":"Bengaluru ","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":89122}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8267278?gh_jid=8267278","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3577136,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, India"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8267278,"updated_at":"2026-10-12T04:36:11-04:00","requisition_id":"P25165_3577136","title":"Digital Solutions Manager (Recruiting Tech & Learning Platforms) ","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-10-09T13:17:17-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Solutions Manager &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Recruiting Tech &amp;amp; Learning Platforms)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within People Experience &amp;amp; AI transformation and serves as the strategic technical and functional capability lead for Okta&#39;s Recruiting and Learning ecosystem. As a Digital Solutions Manager with deep expertise in enterprise systems, integrations, automation, data architecture, and AI, you will define and execute the technology vision that enables scalable hiring, workforce development, and organizational growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will establish the long-term technical and technical strategy for recruiting and learning systems, ensuring our platforms, integrations, data architecture, and AI capabilities work together seamlessly to support global operations. You will translate business priorities into scalable technical solutions, balancing user experience, operational efficiency, governance, and future-state innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate at the intersection of systems architecture, automation, and user experience—building solutions that improve efficiency, enable better decision-making, and support global growth. This role also requires strong AI fluency, with a focus on leveraging AI-driven capabilities to enhance recruiting processes, learning experiences, and operational automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap &amp;amp; Systems&lt;/strong&gt;: Define &amp;amp; execute the roadmap for Recruiting and Learning systems, ensuring alignment with business goals. Serve as the primary SME across ATS, CRM, LMS and AI tools. Design scalable, future-ready architectures, evaluate emerging technologies, and translate complex business needs into strategic technical solutions through partnership with People Technology and Business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations, Automation &amp;amp; Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Technology teams to define requirements for integrations across systems using APIs, middleware, and data pipelines. Drive automation of manual processes across recruiting and learning workflows to improve efficiency and reduce operational overhead. Lead the business side of system implementations—including requirements gathering, process mapping, User Acceptance Testing (UAT), and change management/readiness—while partnering with the technology team for solution design, configuration, and deployment. Continuously identify opportunities to streamline workflows and improve system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Integrity, Reporting &amp;amp; Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain data integrity standards, validation rules, and monitoring processes. Ensure data accuracy, accessibility, and consistency across systems. Partner with analytics teams to align on reporting frameworks and enable actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Enablement &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI-enabled capabilities (e.g., candidate matching, chatbots, recommendations, content generation) to optimize recruiting and learning processes. Evaluate and implement AI-driven tools and features across systems. Identify high-impact use cases for AI to improve efficiency, personalization, and decision-making. Partner with stakeholders to drive responsible and scalable adoption of AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Troubleshooting, Governance &amp;amp; Best Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Troubleshoot complex system issues and perform root cause analysis using structured problem-solving approaches. Partner with IT and Security to ensure system reliability, compliance, and scalability. Establish and document best practices for system configuration, usage, and maintenance. Maintain comprehensive technical documentation (system architecture, data flows, configurations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a technical subject matter expert for recruiting and learning systems within People. Partner with Recruiting and Learning &amp;amp; Development teams to translate business needs into technical solutions. Collaborate with Business Technology / IT on integrations, architecture, and system performance. Engage with vendors and external partners to support implementations and roadmap alignment. Support global users through issue resolution, training, and documentation to drive adoption and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in recruiting systems (ATS, CRM, interview platforms) and Learning Management Systems (LMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in system configuration, architecture, and administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading system implementations and managing medium-to-large complexity technical initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data models, reporting, and system governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to troubleshoot complex issues and perform root cause analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging automation to improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI fluency, including familiarity with AI/ML applications and AI-enabled features in recruiting and learning platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in ambiguous environments and translate business needs into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is foundational to how Okta scales its recruiting and learning capabilities. You will build and maintain the systems that enable efficient hiring, effective learning, and data-driven decision-making across the organization. Your work will directly impact operational efficiency, user experience, and the company&#39;s ability to grow with the right talent and capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI_Hybrid&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI_P25165_3577136&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":80139,"name":"Total Rewards-132","child_ids":[],"parent_id":64400}],"offices":[{"id":89126,"name":"Bengaluru ","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":89122}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8222505?gh_jid=8222505","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3558620,"location":{"name":"Singapore"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8222505,"updated_at":"2026-09-22T02:46:03-04:00","requisition_id":"P8387_3558620","title":"Director, APJ Deal Strategy","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-09-22T02:46:03-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Okta is seeking a world-class deal strategy leader to partner with the APJ GTM teams to grow the business and close the best deals possible. The APJ Deal Strategy lead will set the strategy and direction with APJ GTM leadership to help Okta scale to $4B+, driving innovative approaches and operational excellence to help the field win.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role requires strong cross functional executive collaboration and influence along with the ability to deal with ambiguity, come up with creative solutions and drive urgency with quarterly business cadence while transforming for scale.&amp;nbsp; This leader will have team management responsibilities with the opportunity to further build out a team over time to drive scale in deal coverage and business impact.&amp;nbsp; The person in this role will work across APJ GTM leadership and cross-functional support teams such as Legal and Finance to determine the best deal structures as we ramp up the business. This leader will drive and maintain the deal strategy and operational excellence in alignment with global best practices. In addition, this leader will work with the broader business planning team including P&amp;amp;P, Business Value and Compete along with IT to support successful rollout of new offers and programs to market.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As Okta rapidly launches new innovations and expands into new markets, this role is critical to our success. A successful leader in this role will have a combination of skills across deal strategy &amp;amp; management, customer negotiations, business value positioning, deal analytics, program management, communication, influencing and collaboration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Drive deals management strategies that will help Okta scale to $4B+ in revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work closely with leaders in the GTM teams to craft deal proposals, evaluate and apply new buying programs, business models and monetization strategies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Gather GTM team feedback on deal quality and velocity improvement proposals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Provide well-reasoned deal structuring guidelines and optimization recommendations GTM leaders across the organization and the executive team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Govern commercial terms and non-standard approvals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Define and evaluate Key Performance Indicators to track impact of deal strategies and guidelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Support customer facing discussions where appropriate, to help sales win business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SME support for deal enablement and training content for the sales team to help best position deal commercial terms and conditions with customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Provide targeted in-deal support to the sales team to assist in strategic precedent setting opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Provide leadership to further scale and optimize the team, setting priorities to maximize impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer science, Engineering, Finance, Marketing, Business or an equivalent; MBA preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 2 years of experience (preferably 4) in a deal strategy leadership role. May consider candidates with deal experience and a combination of the following areas: strategy consulting, strategic finance or corporate strategy, ideally at a SaaS or enterprise software company to equal 4 years.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;2 years of direct people management/team management experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to quickly grasp new product and business model concepts, consistently apply critical and structured thinking to new areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Action-oriented to solve problems and get a lot done in short timeframes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated leadership experience driving complex, cross-functional execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Exceptional communication and collaboration skills across all levels of an organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Okta’s Top 5 Core Leadership Competencies are part of the deeply ingrained principles that guide all of our company’s actions. They also align strongly to our cultural cornerstones, our Okta values: love our customers, empower our people, never stop innovating, act with integrity, and maintain transparency. It’s our expectation that our managers and leaders embody these core competencies:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Builds Effective Teams: Building strong-identity teams that apply their diverse skills and perspectives to achieve common goals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Demonstrates Self-Awareness (EQ): Using a combination of feedback and reflection to gain productive insight into personal strengths and weaknesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develops Talent: Developing people to meet both their career goals and the organization’s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drives Results: Consistently achieving results, even under tough circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Mindset: Seeing ahead to future possibilities and translating them into breakthrough strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;247&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we combine flexibility with in-person collaboration. This role follows a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;378&quot;&gt;hybrid model (2 days in-office or on client site, 3 days remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;426&quot;&gt; based out of our local hub. You’ll have dedicated days to connect, brainstorm, and build with the team on-site, alongside the flexibility to work from home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
