&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Ambitious Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently deliver against ARR targets to support 40%+ YOY growth by executing a long-term strategy for net-new logo generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Land &amp;amp; Expand:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify ideal client profiles, uncover new opportunities, and deepen Okta&#39;s footprint across enterprise organizations using a Land, Adopt, Expand, and Deepen model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestrate Complex Enterprise Deals:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead end-to-end sales cycles from prospecting through negotiation and closing, framing Okta’s platform around tangible business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Put Customers First:&lt;/strong&gt; Embody Okta’s core value—&lt;em&gt;Always Love Our Customers&lt;/em&gt;—by solving genuine business challenges and delivering long-term value over short-term wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage the Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate across internal teams (Solutions Engineering, Business Value Management, Customer Success) and external channel/alliance partners to unlock new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Integrity &amp;amp; Polish:&lt;/strong&gt; Engage C-suite stakeholders with active listening, clear communication, and executive presence, establishing yourself as a trusted advisor on Okta&#39;s platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience in enterprise cloud software field sales, with a documented history of meeting/exceeding quotas and closing six-figure deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience selling complex SaaS/Cloud solutions across Identity, Security, Infrastructure Management, App Dev, or Business Applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sales Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with consultative selling methodologies (e.g., MEDDPICC, Challenger) and a track record of thriving in fast-changing, high-growth environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong communication, active listening, and presentation skills needed to engage and negotiate with C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-First Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to leverage channel partners and alliance ecosystems to expand reach and accelerate deal velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree (or equivalent experience); MBA is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
