&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Federal Sales Manager, Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Federal Sales Director –&amp;nbsp; this role will drive the sales process for our Civilian customers. The right candidate for the position will enjoy closing new logos while simultaneously managing and expanding a book of install base customers. Our FSM&#39;s organize and conduct sales presentations, site visits and product demonstrations to prospects and represent Okta in a consistent, effective and professional manner to best develop and win new clients.&lt;/p&gt;
