&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communications skills, with the ability to demonstrate a connection to Okta’s vision and values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to work collaboratively &amp;amp; cross functionally across the Okta and Defense Industrial Base ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive customer and Defense Industrial Base network&lt;/li&gt;
