the most reliable and performant systems on the planet through the skillful use of automation. If you like to be challenged and have a passion for solving large-scale automation, testing, and tuning problems, we would love to hear from you. The ideal candidate is someone who exemplifies the ethics of, “If you have to do something more than once, automate it” and who can rapidly self-educate on new concepts and tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the architecture, design and rollout of the internal developer platform which would span CI/CD, tooling, infrastructure as code (IAC) integrations as well as modernization efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance existing automation for fleet management and build new features as per the needs of the infrastructure platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead initiatives and projects that enhance engineer productivity by identifying and mitigating bottlenecks in the development flow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring, managing, and leading a team of SWEs &amp;amp; SREs with a broad range of expertise and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triaging and troubleshooting complex production issues to ensure reliability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with our stakeholders across the organization to ensure our new capabilities are aligned to our competing constraints of reliability, security, and delivery velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering directly with recruiting and people ops to hire and retain the best talent in the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep sharp eyes on our metrics, including vulnerability scanning and security posture, cloud spend, RPO and RTO, and toil overhead, and ensure our projects are driving our metrics in the right direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting a 24x7 online environment as part of an on-call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are an ideal candidate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform-as-Product Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of building and scaling internal developer platforms (IDP) that treat internal engineering teams as customers, focusing on reducing cognitive load and improving developer velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Excellence in Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience in the &quot;Software&quot; part of SRE—leading teams to build robust, automated tooling for CI/CD orchestration, Kubernetes operators, or self-service infrastructure provisioning (IaC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation First:&lt;/strong&gt; A history of transitioning teams from manual &quot;toil-heavy&quot; operations to automated, code-driven workflows that interact safely with high-scale cloud production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are always willing to go the extra mile: see a problem, fix the problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are passionate about encouraging the development of engineering peers and leading by example&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience managing teams running large-scale production Java/Tomcat and containerized services in AWS (EC2, ECS, KMS, Kinesis, RDS) or other cloud providers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep knowledge of CI/CD principles, Linux fundamentals, OS hardening, networking concepts, and IP protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Required Knowledge, Skills, Abilities, and Qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall experience 8+ years &amp;amp; 2+ years of engineering management experience leading SWE teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;SRE, DevOps, or Platform Engineering teams, with the ability to remain hands-on technically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong hands-on expertise in AWS and GCP&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly Amazon EKS, Kubernetes, cloud-native infrastructure, and production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven automation experience&lt;/strong&gt; with Infrastructure as Code (e.g., Terraform), scripting, and CI/CD, with a strong focus on cloud and Kubernetes security, IAM, and security automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong leadership, communication, and problem-solving skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a BS in Computer Science or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
