and strategy across our marketing channels. You&#39;ll own measurement and analytics for campaigns, partners, and field marketing—including attribution modeling, ROI optimization, and emerging AI capabilities—serving as the go-to analytics expert and thought partner for marketing leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive attribution modeling and full-funnel measurement across all marketing channels, with attention to paid media&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect Paid Ads activity with outcomes on the website and the demand gen funnel to create a holistic view of ad performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create insights around organic and paid traffic and engagement, with increased scrutiny on GEO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data into actionable insights and recommendations for marketing leaders across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create forecasts and scenario models to inform annual budget planning and incremental asks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain self-service dashboards in Tableau for paid media, brand, demand gen, digital, and strategic events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Field Analytics, Strategy &amp;amp; Planning, Marketing Leadership, and Data teams on performance narrative and QBRs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Marketing Data Operations team to maintain data quality across martech systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement AI/ML capabilities for predictive modeling and automated insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and support marketing experiments with rigorous testing and statistical validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide analytical guidance to junior analysts, and establish best practices for the broader analytics function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with analytics tools and methods to drive competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Marketing, Analytics, Operations, or BI in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in marketing analytics: campaign performance, demand gen, field marketing, and ABM measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in paid media analytics across ad platforms, web analytics, and Salesforce&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in web analytics focused on demand generation, engagement, and intent modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of using data to drive business strategy and budget decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across enterprise sales, product-led growth, and partner marketing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
