&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in marketing attribution modeling and multi-touch measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data storytelling: communicate complex insights to executives and influence decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of martech infrastructure: database management, data hygiene, API integrations (ad platforms, CRM, analytics tools, data warehouse)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Tableau, Salesforce, Snowflake, Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical analysis, A/B testing, and experimental design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and guide the work of others without formal management authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML experience: predictive modeling, propensity scoring, marketing mix modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Analytics (GA4) or Adobe Analytics expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with FiveTran Ad schemas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth marketing or demand gen background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Privacy-first measurement, DSPs, programmatic advertising experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, R, or similar statistical tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree (MBA, Analytics, Economics, or related field)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
