s-functional, and broader company-wide initiatives. Deep understanding of business value propositions and better together positioning with assigned focus partners. Owns, builds and drives the strategies and plans with specific assigned focus partners / partner types. Builds and executes Partner + Marketing initiatives, campaigns or programs leveraging templates and frameworks working closely with cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience: 8+ years of related experience in a professional role with a Bachelor’s degree; or 6+ years with a Master’s degree&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner Marketing Execution &amp;amp; Support:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joint Campaign Planning: Collaborate with partners to design and execute joint marketing campaigns, such as webinars, events, or digital advertising.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Asset Creation: Develop co-branded materials like whitepapers, solution briefs, and social media content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Funding Support: Manage Market Development Funds (MDF) to financially support partner-led marketing initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with the regional marketing team to identify opportunities to incorporate focus partners into existing Okta-led initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with the APJ Strategic Partner Marketing Manager on logistical tasks related to GSI and CSP partners as directed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relationship &amp;amp; Event Execution:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a primary marketing contact for a set of focus partners, assisting the APJ Partner Marketing Lead with relationship maintenance and communication&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and execute for key in-region events, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner Connects and Partner Forum events in ANZ in alignment with APJ lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key in region Tech Alliance events, such as: AWS Summits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Showcasing Partner Success: Highlight partner achievements and solutions through case studies, blogs, or videos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regular Communications: Ensure ongoing communications with partners, sharing product updates, new campaigns, and marketing best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demand Generation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborative Demand Generation: Work with partners to create demand-generation campaigns and events aimed at attracting and converting leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead Sharing and Tracking: Facilitate the process for lead sharing between the company and its partners, ensuring accountability and follow-through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tracking ROI: Measure the effectiveness of partner marketing initiatives in driving pipeline, revenue, and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Feedback Loops: Use data and partner feedback to refine strategies and improve program outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Internal Team Alignment &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaboration with Sales: Work closely with the partner sales team to align marketing initiatives with revenue goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrated GTM Planning: Work closely with Marketing Pod teams to embed partner marketing strategies into global and theater level plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Marketing Integration: Ensure partner messaging aligns with the company’s broader product positioning and GTM strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Campaign Execution: Successful on-time and on-budget delivery of assigned co-branded marketing activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner Activation: Number of assigned partners actively utilising co-marketing materials or participating in joint campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MDF Process Compliance: Aligning closely with MDF Administrator for timely submission of MDF claims for executed activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline Support: Contribution to the team&#39;s partner-attached pipeline goal through assigned execution activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;247&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we combine flexibility with in-person collaboration. This role follows a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;378&quot;&gt;hybrid model (2 days in-office or on client site, 3 days remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;426&quot;&gt; based out of our local hub. You’ll have dedicated days to connect, brainstorm, and build with the team on-site, alongside the flexibility to work from home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RITH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
