ture of secure, enterprise-grade cloud automation and system connectivity. We are looking for a Principal Engineer to join our global Automation Engineering team to design, scale, and govern our enterprise integration substrate using AWS cloud services and modern iPaaS platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;390&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a20c2392ae5d&quot;&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role for a hands-on system engineer who can set technical standards, establish integration best practices, and partner with cross-functional teams to automate complex business workflows at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;390&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a20c2392ae5d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;646&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d7dc58420771&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt; the architecture and strategy for self-service cloud automations, creating paved paths that enable builders across Okta to connect enterprise systems seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;817&quot; data-local-id=&quot;99b33e63578c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design, build, and deploy&lt;/strong&gt; high-throughput event-driven integration flows, API gateways, and async orchestration workflows using AWS serverless architectures and iPaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;998&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9339ab27dfe4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; reusable frameworks, developer SDKs, self-service primitives, and integration templates to streamline automation delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1130&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd0c3054fc3e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Serve as&lt;/strong&gt; a technical expert on AWS cloud services and modern iPaaS tooling, driving scalable architecture, reliability, and builder enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;37b135e4b9da&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner with&lt;/strong&gt; operations, security, and platform teams to strengthen monitoring, observability, structured audit logging, and automated governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1427&quot; data-local-id=&quot;53546de72a29&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mentor&lt;/strong&gt; engineers and influence engineering culture across teams, instilling a platform engineering mindset and raising the bar on code quality and DevEx.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1584&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20cf07657d79&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate with&lt;/strong&gt; security, compliance, and business stakeholders to ensure self-service automations are secure, resilient, zero-trust aligned, and enterprise-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1752&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e749e1b5dc9f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Maintain and enhance&lt;/strong&gt; platform primitives and integration components to meet evolving enterprise and builder requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1904&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4cd99d2ea60c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;12+ years of&lt;/strong&gt; software engineering experience in Java and Python, focused on platform engineering, backend systems, distributed architectures, and enterprise integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;44d6a45e59e7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;6+ years of&lt;/strong&gt; hands-on experience with modern front-end frameworks (React, Next.js, TypeScript) to build intuitive developer portals, operator dashboards, and self-service interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2263&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c4b8e289c9bb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deep expertise with&lt;/strong&gt; AWS and event-driven architectures alongside enterprise iPaaS platforms (Zapier, n8n, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2378&quot; data-local-id=&quot;55f2a999cd5c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of&lt;/strong&gt; software engineering best practices: &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;IaC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (Terraform/CloudFormation), CI/CD release automation, API contract design (REST/GraphQL), and unit/integration testing standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2572&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a5176f71d50&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience in&lt;/strong&gt; platform reliability, central logging, error recovery, operational observability, and self-service governance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2711&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1501623b7462&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success in&lt;/strong&gt; building internal platform tools, self-service capabilities, or paved paths that empower and accelerate engineering teams across an enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2882&quot; data-local-id=&quot;079049eb5549&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with&lt;/strong&gt; AI development and integrations, embedding LLM capabilities, agentic primitives, or intelligent features into cloud automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3039&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d881a57ad3ee&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&lt;/strong&gt; AI-driven &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SDLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; practices, leveraging AI-assisted coding tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor) to accelerate software delivery while maintaining safety and quality guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join us :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Okta, you’ll join a global Automation Engineering team building secure, enterprise-grade cloud automation and system connectivity. You’ll shape the platform foundations, integration patterns, and self-service capabilities that help teams automate complex workflows at scale. If you’re passionate about building platforms that are &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;scalable, resilient, and secure&lt;/strong&gt;, this is your opportunity to make an impact across Okta.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#P8396_3395775&lt;/p&gt;
