&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":44027,"name":"SW Eng - Infrastructure-672","child_ids":[],"parent_id":396304}],"offices":[{"id":89126,"name":"Bengaluru ","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":89122}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8071508?gh_jid=8071508","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3497191,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, India"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8071508,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T12:43:00-04:00","requisition_id":"P25470_3497191","title":"Principal Software Engineer ","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-08-17T01:01:43-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to know Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company. We free everyone to safely use any technology, anywhere, on any device or app. Our flexible and neutral products, Okta Platform and Auth0 Platform, provide secure access, authentication, and automation, placing identity at the core of business security and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We are not looking for someone who checks every single box - we’re looking for lifelong learners and people who can make us better with their unique experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team! We’re building a world where Identity belongs to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Okta’s Enterprise Access Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company. We free everyone to safely use any technology—anywhere, on any device or app. Our Workforce and Customer Identity Clouds enable secure yet flexible access, authentication, and automation that transforms how people move through the digital world, putting Identity at the heart of business security and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Enterprise Access team drives billions of authentications every month. The team builds and supports single sign-on, strong authentication, provisioning, and threat protection technologies. Our Enterprise Access service runs in the cloud on a secure, reliable, extensively audited platform with 99.99% availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Principal Software Engineer for the SIW Platform team. Operating under the larger Enterprise Access pillar, the SIW Platform team owns Okta’s secure web experiences for end-user authentication and access. As a technical leader on this team, you will drive the architectural vision for the Okta Sign-In Widget (SIW)—a highly secure, open-source login platform used by millions daily and extended by both our internal feature teams and external customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive the technical vision, architecture, and long-term strategy for the SIW platform, ensuring it meets enterprise-grade standards for security, scalability, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of core platform features and foundational framework components, making decisions that enable extensibility for other engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Management, Design, and other Principal Engineers to shape the product roadmap and translate complex business requirements into a sustainable technical strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead the resolution of the most complex technical challenges, including performance bottlenecks, security vulnerabilities, and architectural limitations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion technical excellence and innovation, identifying and advocating for new technologies and approaches that advance Okta&#39;s identity platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize applications for speed, scalability, and responsiveness across various devices and browsers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, modular, well-tested, and maintainable code, adhering to best practices and coding standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and address technical debt, performance bottlenecks, and areas for improvement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of software development experience, with at least 8 years focused on designing and building complex, enterprise-grade web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience as a technical leader, with a proven track record of architecting and delivering large-scale, high-impact software projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep mastery of the modern frontend ecosystem, including expert-level knowledge of React and TypeScript, with a nuanced understanding of state management, component architecture, and performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving skills and the ability to navigate ambiguity and make high-judgment technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to mentor senior engineers and influence technical direction across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with modern frontend stacks, including JavaScript/TypeScript, frameworks like React, and tooling such as Webpack or Vite.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid understanding of modern JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, and CSS3.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with server-side languages such as Java or C#.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with testing frameworks (e.g., Jest, React Testing Library, Playwright) and a commitment to writing comprehensive tests.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of web security principles, secure coding practices, and accessibility standards (WCAG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of IAM protocols (e.g., OAuth, OIDC, SAML) and identity management concepts is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cybersecurity principles and secure coding practice is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education and Training:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of software development experience, with at least 8 years of experience designing and building enterprise grade software&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;P25470_3497191&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":44026,"name":"SW Eng - Core Identity-670","child_ids":[],"parent_id":396304}],"offices":[{"id":89126,"name":"Bengaluru ","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":89122}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8282012?gh_jid=8282012","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3582332,"location":{"name":"San Francisco, California"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8282012,"updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:53:54-04:00","requisition_id":"P26074_3582332","title":"Principal Software Engineer, Applied AI","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-10-15T13:53:54-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Principal Software Engineer Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team that built Jeeva AI is building Digital Workers, a new suite of autonomous agents for identity operations and security inside Okta. The team works directly with Todd McKinnon, Okta&#39;s co-founder and CEO, with the opportunity to bring this product to Okta&#39;s 20,000+ customers. You will help shape the product with the ownership and pace of a startup and the resources of a public company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build the harnesses and evaluations that make these workers reliable. They investigate risk, use tools, wait for approvals and complete tasks across enterprise systems. Bring depth in agent execution or model quality and help turn it into working software customers can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Production builder&lt;/em&gt;: You have shipped AI software and know what changes when real users depend on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Careful evaluator&lt;/em&gt;: You investigate failures and use evidence to judge quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strong owner:&lt;/em&gt; You follow an improvement through code, evaluation, release and customer use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the agent harness for planning, tool use, memory, context compaction, interruption and recovery during long-running work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate OpenAI and Anthropic model APIs. Select models using measured quality, latency and cost, with clear failure handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate existing harnesses and build only the missing pieces. Keep the harness connected to AWS workflow execution and approval state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep authorization and sensitive writes behind application policy checks. Require evidence of the resulting state before marking work complete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build evaluation datasets and replay tests for valid findings, access decisions, app setup and AI agent onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure false positives, missed risks, unsafe actions, completion rate and cost. Turn production failures into regression tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test prompt injection, stale evidence, conflicting instructions and unsafe tool use. Protect tenant boundaries in retrieval and memory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve prompts, retrieval, tools and model routing. Evaluate fine-tuning or other post-training methods when results justify them and data use is approved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python engineering skills and experience shipping an LLM application that uses tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building agent workflows or evaluation systems for tool-using LLM applications. For harness work, relevant experience includes Claude Agent SDK, OpenAI Codex SDK, Strands Agents, LangChain Deep Agents, LangGraph or a custom implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating model APIs, structured outputs and asynchronous services. Experience with OpenAI or Anthropic is especially relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depth in agent execution or evaluation systems, with working code and failure analysis you can explain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to distinguish a plausible model response from a supported finding or verified action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope by level&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Principal: Set product engineering direction across workflows and implement the shared components that help the team ship faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core stack is Python FastAPI, AWS Step Functions, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, PostgreSQL on Amazon RDS and pgvector. OpenAI and Anthropic model APIs are part of the integration plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We plan to add an agent harness and a dedicated analytics layer using ClickHouse or BigQuery. The harness choice is open. Experience with equivalent tools also counts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And extra credit for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-source contributions, agent observability, security evaluations or synthetic evaluation data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fine-tuning, preference data, post-training evaluation or model distillation using approved datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and security workflows. Foundation-model research experience is optional.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
