&lt;li data-start=&quot;2469&quot; data-end=&quot;2573&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2471&quot; data-end=&quot;2573&quot;&gt;10+ years of field sales experience, consistently demonstrating high performance and a growth mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2574&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2576&quot; data-end=&quot;2694&quot;&gt;Proven success selling enterprise cloud software into Australian Federal Government (or Federal-aligned agencies).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2695&quot; data-end=&quot;2809&quot;&gt;
