&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2810&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2812&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot;&gt;Experience collaborating with partners and reseller channels to drive customer alignment and territory growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2923&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2925&quot; data-end=&quot;3017&quot;&gt;A strong track record in new business development, consistently exceeding financial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3091&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3020&quot; data-end=&quot;3091&quot;&gt;A curious mindset, adaptability, and a passion for learning and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3092&quot; data-end=&quot;3189&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3094&quot; data-end=&quot;3189&quot;&gt;Executive presence, strong communication skills, and the ability to engage senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3190&quot; data-end=&quot;3303&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3192&quot; data-end=&quot;3303&quot;&gt;Experience with solution selling and/or consultative sales techniques; familiarity with MEDDPICC is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3304&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3306&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;Based in Canberra (or willing to be Canberra-based).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3304&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3306&quot; data-end=&quot;3362&quot;&gt;A bachelor’s degree in a relevant field or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
