&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for driven, curious individuals who thrive in fast-paced environments, embrace feedback, and want to make a tangible impact every day. As an SDR at Okta, you&#39;ll do more than prospect — you’ll uncover real business challenges, collaborate cross-functionally, and set the foundation for meaningful customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research accounts and contacts to develop thoughtful outreach strategies using tools like Salesforce, Outreach, and LinkedIn Sales Navigator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing and Account Executives to plan and execute prospecting campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage inbound leads and perform outbound outreach to generate high-quality meetings and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct discovery conversations to understand business needs and tee up your Account Executives for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit your call, email, meeting, and pipeline goals — and have fun doing it, with team competitions, shout-outs, and ongoing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep your data organized and up-to-date in Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional partners to continuously improve how we connect with our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–12 months of prior business experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;strong communicator&lt;/strong&gt;, written and verbal — you know how to connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-motivated and goal-oriented&lt;/strong&gt; — you take initiative and follow through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing priorities in a fast-paced, evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coachable&lt;/strong&gt; — you’re open to feedback and eager to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt; — you ask great questions and are always looking to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales tools like Salesforce, Outreach, and Sales Navigator is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Few Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role is onsite in our San Francisco office 4 days per week (Mon–Thurs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you&#39;re not already local, you’ll need to relocate within an agreed-upon timeframe — note that&amp;nbsp;Okta does not provide relocation assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll attend in-person onboarding in either San Francisco or Chicago to kick off your journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you need a reasonable accommodation during the application or interview process,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/careers/&quot;&gt; let us know here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Okta?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You could sell anything — so why not sell something that truly matters?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Okta, we help people and businesses access the technology they need safely and easily. And behind our mission is a culture of trust, growth, and belonging. We invest in our people with real support, meaningful work, and the freedom to take ownership of your career from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Join us, and you won’t just be starting a job — you’ll be joining a company that’s defining what’s next in identity, and building a safer digital world for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Learn more about Okta’s Sales Development Program&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sales-development-program-okta-amer-promo.splashthat.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Below is the annual On Target Compensation (OTE) range for candidates located in San Francisco Bay Area. Your actual OTE, which is inclusive of base salary and incentive compensation, will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable) and benefits, including health, dental and vision insurance, 401(k), flexible spending account, and paid leave (including PTO and parental leave) in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit:&lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.okta.com/us&quot;&gt; https://rewards.okta.com/us&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The OTE range for this position for candidates located in the San Francisco Bay area is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$82,011.43&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$82,011.43 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":28491,"name":"Sales Development-310","child_ids":[],"parent_id":29631}],"offices":[{"id":19611,"name":"San Francisco","location":"San Francisco, CA, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":67252}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/7860180?gh_jid=7860180","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3423316,"location":{"name":"Sydney, Australia"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":7860180,"updated_at":"2026-09-21T12:43:00-04:00","requisition_id":"P25122_3423316","title":"Sales Strategy & Operations Manager, ANZ","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-04-28T01:52:55-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company.&lt;/strong&gt; We free everyone to safely use any technology—anywhere, on any device or app. Our Workforce and Customer Identity Clouds enable secure yet flexible access, authentication, and automation that transforms how people move through the digital world, putting Identity at the heart of business security and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We aren’t looking for someone who simply checks boxes; we’re looking for lifelong learners and &quot;owners&quot; who want to build the future of Identity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us. Build a world where Identity belongs to you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity: Your Career-Defining Moment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team is the engine room of Okta’s growth. We don&#39;t just report on the business; we architect it. As a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Strategy and Operations Manager &lt;/strong&gt;for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;ANZ region&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a strategic co-pilot to Sales Leadership. This role will also give exposure to strategic initiatives across APJ and Global Sales Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a &quot;back-office&quot; role. This is a high-visibility position for a high-potential talent who wants to own the &quot;How&quot; and &quot;Why&quot; behind our go-to-market execution. Joining us in a time of rapid expansion across APJ, you will leverage the next frontier of technology to redefine what &quot;operational excellence&quot; looks like in the SaaS era.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Make an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategic Partnership &amp;amp; Sales Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear the Path:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner directly with ANZ Sales Leadership to identify and dismantle friction in the sales process. You are the bridge between strategy and execution, ensuring our reps spend less time on systems and more time with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive the Business:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor, providing the insights, territory planning, and quota structures that empower leaders to hit their targets with precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Cross-Functional Ecosystem Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unify the Power of Okta:&lt;/strong&gt; Work across Partners, Marketing, Finance, and Customer Success to ensure we are leveraging the full weight of the Okta functions. Your goal is to maximize outcomes not just for our employees, but for our entire ecosystem of prospects, customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Discipline:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the annual planning process for the sales organization, architecting headcount, territory design, quota planning, pipeline targets that reflect our ambitious growth trajectory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Innovation through AI &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect the Future:&lt;/strong&gt; Move beyond traditional reporting. You will lead the charge in integrating &lt;strong&gt;AI and Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt; workflows into our GTM tech stack to automate mundane tasks and provide predictive insights for Marketing and Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize the Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Master and evolve our use of Salesforce, Gong, and Clari, ensuring these tools aren&#39;t just stand alone capabilities, but competitive advantages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of professional experience, with at least 3 years in a high-intensity business partnering role - preferably in SaaS (Sales Ops, Strategy Consulting, or Finance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a &quot;Superstar&quot; self-starter. You don&#39;t wait for a playbook; you write it. You have a relentless curiosity and a desire to &quot;own&quot; your domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving DNA:&lt;/strong&gt; You can take an ambiguous business challenge, break it down into a structured project plan, and deliver data-driven results under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in the GTM Stack (such as Gong, Tableau, Salesforce, Clari).&amp;nbsp; You are an &lt;strong&gt;AI-first thinker&lt;/strong&gt;— you are always thinking about how to leverage the tech stack to improve efficiencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;247&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we combine flexibility with in-person collaboration. This role follows a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;378&quot;&gt;hybrid model (2 days in-office or on client site, 3 days remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;426&quot;&gt; based out of our local hub. You’ll have dedicated days to connect, brainstorm, and build with the team on-site, alongside the flexibility to work from home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-BI1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P25122_3423316&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":28538,"name":"Business Operations-150","child_ids":[],"parent_id":30147}],"offices":[{"id":19615,"name":"Sydney","location":"Sydney, New South Wales, Australia","child_ids":[],"parent_id":80308}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8257554?gh_jid=8257554","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3573129,"location":{"name":"Bellevue, Washington; Chicago, Illinois; San Francisco, California; Washington, DC"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8257554,"updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:29:35-04:00","requisition_id":"P25967_3573129","title":"Senior AI Analyst, People Digital Solutions","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-10-08T09:19:08-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The People Operations &amp;amp; Digital Solutions team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The People Operations &amp;amp; Digital Solutions team shapes the future of employee support at Okta through innovative technology, intelligent knowledge management, and automated self-service experiences. Reporting to the Senior Director, People Operations &amp;amp; Digital Solutions, this team collaborates closely with People Operations, Total Rewards, Recruiting, IT, Learning, and Knowledge Management to enhance digital support across the enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Senior AI Analyst opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Senior AI Analyst with a strong background in ServiceNow and Analytics to help train, evaluate, and improve AI models and AI-powered enterprise solutions. The ideal candidate will combine hands-on ServiceNow knowledge, data and analytics expertise, and strong communication skills to create high-quality training data, evaluate AI outputs, and translate business and technical requirements into effective AI training scenarios. This is a high-impact role responsible for improving how employees interact with AI while enabling support teams through intelligent knowledge management and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the subject matter expert for our AI solutions, you will analyze conversational insights, optimize AI performance, and ensure AI assistants deliver accurate, relevant, and trusted responses. You&#39;ll own the training and continuous improvement of AI-powered experiences—including an employee support chatbot, Agentic Coach, and future AI assistants—while partnering with cross-functional teams to enhance knowledge, self-service, and employee support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train, test, and evaluate AI-powered assistants, chatbots, and agentic AI solutions to ensure accurate and reliable employee experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize prompts, conversational flows, intents, responses, and training scenarios across enterprise support platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate AI outputs for accuracy, relevance, completeness, tone, and consistency while identifying and mitigating hallucinations, response gaps, or misinformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze AI performance metrics such as containment, resolution, user satisfaction, engagement, and escalation rates; identify trends, emerging intents, knowledge gaps, and opportunities for automation from conversational data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply ServiceNow knowledge to translate complex business processes into intuitive conversational scenarios, training data, and evaluation criteria; collaborate with ServiceNow administrators, developers, analysts, and business stakeholders to identify automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain AI training materials, test cases, evaluation criteria, and sample conversations; partner with Knowledge Management teams to improve content quality, discoverability, and AI readiness; keep materials current as products, processes, and policies evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing and rollout of new AI capabilities and enhancements; provide insights and recommendations based on AI performance, user feedback, and analytics to drive continuous improvement across the People Organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with developments in generative AI, prompt engineering, conversational AI, agentic AI, and responsible AI; contribute ideas that improve employee self-service and digital support experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;5+ years of analytics experience using tools such as SQL, Excel, Power BI, or Tableau.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of ServiceNow or a similar enterprise service-management platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Experience training, evaluating, and optimizing AI models, conversational agents, or LLM-powered assistants, including agentic AI solutions, in employee or customer support environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of responsible AI practices and prompt engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Ability to analyze conversational data and performance metrics to drive measurable improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Experience with enterprise conversational AI platforms or AI-enabled search technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to translate technical and business requirements into clear, user-focused content and influence cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;text-start  svelte-4sys19&quot;&gt;Understanding of knowledge management and omnichannel service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And extra credit if you have experience in any of the following!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic, proactive, and solution-oriented mindset with a passion for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity for emerging AI technologies and a commitment to driving innovation across the People Digital Solutions ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a pivotal role in shaping the future of AI-powered employee support at Okta. By combining AI training, knowledge optimization, analytics, and innovation, you&#39;ll help build intelligent support experiences that improve employee satisfaction, increase self-service success, and enable support teams to deliver exceptional service at scale. In this role, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to work at the intersection of cutting-edge generative AI and enterprise technology, directly impacting how thousands of Okta employees interact with digital support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MC1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#P25967_3573129&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual base salary range for this position for candidates located in the San Francisco Bay area is between:  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$121,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Below is the annual base salary range for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York and Washington. Your actual base salary will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable), bonus, and benefits, including health, dental and vision insurance, 401(k), flexible spending account, and paid leave (including PTO and parental leave) in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.okta.com/us&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;https://rewards.okta.com/us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual base salary range for this position for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York, and Washington is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$108,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$149,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":80139,"name":"Total Rewards-132","child_ids":[],"parent_id":64400}],"offices":[{"id":67252,"name":"United States","location":null,"child_ids":[85788,73666,19613,61722,19611,22604,21495,19612,21497,21496],"parent_id":67248}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8230852?gh_jid=8230852","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3561810,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, India"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8230852,"updated_at":"2026-09-25T12:39:18-04:00","requisition_id":"P25739_3561810","title":"Senior Application Development Analyst","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-09-25T12:39:18-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company. We free everyone to safely use any technology anywhere, on any device or app. Our Workforce and Customer Identity Clouds enable secure yet flexible access, authentication, and automation that transforms how people move through the digital world, putting Identity at the heart of business security and growth. At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We are not looking for someone who checks every single box we’re looking for lifelong learners and people who can make us better with their unique experiences. The Technology Data and Intelligence (TDI) team at Okta is dedicated to boosting internal efficiency through the implementation of secure, scalable, and innovative systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Salesforce Product Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join the TDI team and help scale our internal systems with a focus on security and reliability. You will leverage your deep knowledge of CPQ and Sales Cloud, covering everything from provisioning to case management, to partner with GTM teams and uncover data-driven efficiencies. In this role, your work will bridge the gap between business needs and technical solutions to drive operational success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements Gathering and Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with business stakeholders to understand their requirements and challenges, translating them into detailed and actionable user stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct thorough analysis of existing processes and systems to identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salesforce CPQ Configuration&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage your expertise in Salesforce CPQ to implement solutions that align with business needs. This includes product and price rule configuration, and advanced approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design and Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with developers and administrators to design and implement enhancements and customizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Salesforce CPQ and Salesforce.com platform updates as a core member of a team responsible for the design, development, testing, and release of enhancements and strategic projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with different functions such as Deal Desk, Partner Ops, Order Management, Pricing and Packaging, and Sales Ops to design, implement, and enhance the CPQ platform for Direct and Channel Sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Management and Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the integrity and accuracy of Salesforce data through effective data management practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain reports and dashboards to provide insights into key performance metrics and support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Integrations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical teams to design and implement integrations between Salesforce and other systems within the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure seamless data flow and interoperability between Salesforce and external applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Assurance and Testing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive test plans to validate the functionality and performance of Salesforce solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with QA teams to address and resolve any issues identified during testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security and Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that Salesforce solutions adhere to organizational security policies and industry regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User Journey &amp;amp; Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Author and maintain end-to-end User Journey Maps. You will update system documentation to reflect AI-driven automations and &quot;Human-in-the-loop&quot; decision points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that technical and user documentation is accessible and easily understandable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salesforce Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of hands-on experience as a Business Analyst or Implementation Consultant specializing in Salesforce Sales Cloud and CPQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience with &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, specifically connecting CRM platforms with product-led systems and cross-functional tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to own the end-to-end delivery lifecycle, from initial conception and configuration through to launch and post-deployment support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certifications:&lt;/strong&gt; Salesforce Certified Administrator, Sales Cloud Consultant, or CPQ Specialist credentials are highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Analytical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong problem-solving mindset focused on continuous process improvement and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;AI solutions&lt;/strong&gt; and their application in enhancing analytical workflows and data insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Critical Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate complex business requirements into scalable, high-quality technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of collaborating with diverse business teams and stakeholders to align goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Collaboration &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated strong ownership and the ability to communicate effectively and collaborate seamlessly with cross-functional, global teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter who takes initiative to find solutions independently and consistently delivers accurate, timely results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join us :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in a fast-paced, innovative environment that values continuous learning and professional growth. This role offers the opportunity to collaborate with cross-functional teams to make a direct impact on the business while driving strategic improvements. As a key contributor, you will help shape the future of our Salesforce-based processes and operational landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#P25739_3561810&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI_Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":72394,"name":"BT Go To Market Technology-173","child_ids":[],"parent_id":30147}],"offices":[{"id":89126,"name":"Bengaluru ","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":89122}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8262246?gh_jid=8262246","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3574964,"location":{"name":"Bellevue, Washington; Chicago, Illinois; San Francisco, California"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8262246,"updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:46:37-04:00","requisition_id":"P25291_3574964","title":"Senior Art Director, Demand Gen","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-10-08T12:36:13-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Brand &amp;amp; Creative Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Brand &amp;amp; Creative team shapes how the world perceives Okta and Auth0. We are a multidisciplinary collective of art directors, copywriters, designers, producers, and strategists who believe that enterprise software creative should be as thoughtful, inventive, and memorable as the best consumer work. We partner across the company to build cohesive, high-craft brand expressions that not only elevate our aesthetic identity but also drive measurable commercial momentum.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Senior Art Director, Demand Gen Role at Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced, performance-minded &lt;strong&gt;Senior Art Director, Demand Gen&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as the visual creative lead for our global demand generation and growth initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will sit at the intersection of brand excellence and high-velocity performance marketing. You will lead visual concepting and end-to-end art direction for integrated campaigns across our core solution pillars, including AI innovations, workforce identity, customer identity, and developer platforms. From strategic brainstorms to scalable design toolkits, you will shape the creative experiences that engage enterprise decision-makers, guide prospects through complex buying journeys, and drive pipeline growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role requiring both conceptual vision and hands-on execution. You will champion design craft while embracing performance analytics, A/B testing, and modular systems to continuously elevate our creative output.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing at Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Campaign Art Direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the visual creative lead for integrated, global demand generation campaigns, establishing distinct aesthetic direction, narrative hierarchy, and design standards that elevate the Okta brand across digital channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct End-to-End Digital Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Concept, design, and direct cohesive multi-channel asset suites across the entire conversion funnel, including paid acquisition (social, programmatic, and search display), high-converting landing pages, interactive product tours, gated research reports, and email journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner on Growth Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with Demand Gen leaders, Global Campaign managers, and copywriters to translate campaign briefs, pipeline targets, and technical concepts into compelling visual narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iterate with Performance Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with marketing operations and growth marketers to evaluate campaign analytics, engagement heatmaps, and creative A/B testing results, translating quantitative findings into iterative design refinements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Brand Guidelines in Performance Channels:&lt;/strong&gt; Extend Okta’s core brand identity into high-conversion environments, ensuring visual consistency, accessibility (WCAG compliance), and responsive web standards without sacrificing design integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Reusable Design Toolkits:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop modular Figma components, campaign templates, and layout systems that empower the team to scale asset production quickly while maintaining exceptional quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Creative Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with dedicated copywriters, motion designers, web producers, and external creative agencies from initial brief through final asset handoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extensive Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years of art direction or senior visual design experience, with a proven focus on multi-channel digital campaigns, demand generation, or performance creative within B2B SaaS, enterprise tech, or top-tier digital agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Stellar Digital Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; A comprehensive portfolio showcasing sophisticated typography, visual hierarchy, layout design, and modular creative systems across digital touchpoints (ad packages, conversion web pages, editorial assets, and interactive experiences).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Conversion Design Intuition:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise in UX/UI best practices, digital visual hierarchy, mobile-first design, and conversion rate optimization (CRO) methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mastery of Creative Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency with Figma and Adobe Creative Cloud (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign), paired with modern asset management and workflow tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Informed Creative Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort reviewing performance metrics, understanding A/B testing frameworks, and using data to inform creative iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Communication &amp;amp; Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong verbal and visual presentation skills, with the ability to articulate design rationale and strategic thinking clearly to marketing executives, product teams, and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive, self-starter mentality with experience partnering closely with copywriters and mentoring junior or mid-level designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience designing for enterprise cybersecurity, cloud infrastructure, or developer platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of motion design (After Effects, Lottie) or rich media animation for paid social and digital ad units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with front-end web technologies (HTML, CSS) and web design frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
