needs and goals. Works with autonomy, knows when to involve others for support. Is proactive about planning and communicating program initiatives and updates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is hybrid and requires working out of our San Francisco office two days a week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and scale complex, ambiguous, and high visibility learning programs, end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop engaging, creative, and impactful in-person, blended, and virtual, and self-paced learning experiences&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive collaboration with stakeholders to align global learning and development principles for a smooth and effective learner experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch, maintain, and scale learning experiences that promote the company’s learning brand and participant engagement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use available information to inform learning initiatives, including: internal research, external research, and partnership with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to design, prototype, personalize, and scale learning content faster than traditional methods allow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Delivery&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, run, and communicate all operational components of your programs, with documentation and governance built in&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute program marketing and change-management plans that build participation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take lead to ensure all components of a curriculum are complete, deployed, and managed appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule and facilitate learning sessions in various modalities and for various cohort sizes and structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute program marketing plans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Maintenance &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish key program metrics, milestones, and goals before launch, including adoption, skill progression, behavior change, and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program and project reporting, administration, resource/budget management, stakeholder management, planning, and communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep program plans, status, and health visible to stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze program data to find opportunities, report results to senior leadership, and make clear recommendations on where to invest next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and improve the learning tech stack, including our LMS, authoring tools, and AI-enabled tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for program management and share best practices across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
