 has a strong emphasis on continued learning and development. We’re looking for a Senior Manager to lead our Solution Engineering team in IMETA located in Dublin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior Manager, Solution Engineering you would…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of multiple talented Solution Engineers across multiple regions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% travel expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary Location in Dublin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide coaching and development to your team ensuring professional growth and career development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective relationships with cross functional leaders such as Sales, Marketing, Customer Success and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR, Finance and Operations to look at skills gaps, workforce planning and budget alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Recruitment to build best in class hiring plans and go to market strategies. Interview, assess, conduct case studies and navigate offers to secure the best talent for Okta.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your Manager peers around best practice, market trends, employee internal moves and the overall functions strategy to support the team as they scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Still remain hands on and be able to support your team with technical questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an ambassador for your team with the Product functions to deliver feedback from the field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for experience…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years or more experience managing high performing pre-sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing Middle East and or African markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiting in a high growth environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the MEDDICC sales qualification framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In a pre-sales / Solution Engineering / Sales Engineering role that is a blend of technical detail and value selling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and presenting technical demonstrations for customers and being very comfortable with technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills gained in the security or identity space, such as IAM, CIAM, VPN, MDM, Active Directory, LDAP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge around the Okta platform and competitor product offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta’s Top 5 Core Leadership Competencies are part of the deeply ingrained principles that guide all of our company’s actions. They also align strongly to our cultural cornerstones, our Okta values: love our customers, empower our people, never stop innovating, act with integrity, and maintain transparency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s our expectation that our managers and leaders embody these core competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds Effective Teams: Building strong-identity teams that apply their diverse skills and perspectives to achieve common goals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates Self-Awareness (EQ): Using a combination of feedback and reflection to gain productive insight into personal strengths and weaknesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops Talent: Developing people to meet both their career goals and the organization’s goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives Results: Consistently achieving results, even under tough circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Mindset: Seeing ahead to future possibilities and translating them into breakthrough strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
