 enterprise-grade cloud automation and system connectivity. We are looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our global Automation Engineering team to design, scale, and govern our enterprise integration substrate using AWS cloud services and modern iPaaS platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;439&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eab033c54b9c&quot;&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role for a hands-on system engineer who can set technical standards, establish integration best practices, and partner with cross-functional teams to automate complex business workflows at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;439&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eab033c54b9c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll do :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;695&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e2b3658fe527&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Lead technical design and execution for automation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; within the team, creating paved paths that enable builders across Okta to connect enterprise systems seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;874&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c69ebf89fd5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design, build, and deploy high-throughput event-driven integration flows&lt;/strong&gt;, API gateways, and async orchestration workflows using AWS architectures and iPaaS platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1044&quot; data-local-id=&quot;367565a46335&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Build reusable frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;, developer SDKs, self-service primitives, and integration templates to streamline automation delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1176&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6a685ce807a1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Serve as a technical domain expert on AWS cloud services&lt;/strong&gt; and modern iPaaS tooling, driving scalable architecture, reliability, and builder enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1330&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f796b761d5bb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Partner with operations, security, and platform teams&lt;/strong&gt; to strengthen monitoring, observability, structured audit logging, and automated governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1480&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4196e0fc0a6e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Mentor team members and participate in cross-functional design reviews&lt;/strong&gt;, instilling a platform engineering mindset and raising the bar on code quality and DevEx.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1644&quot; data-local-id=&quot;531955e2c52d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Collaborate with security, compliance, and business stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to ensure self-service automations are secure, resilient, zero-trust aligned, and enterprise-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1812&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ff3878e8c711&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Maintain and enhance platform primitives&lt;/strong&gt; and integration components to meet evolving enterprise and builder requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1964&quot; data-local-id=&quot;655adcbc795d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;5+ years of&lt;/strong&gt; software engineering experience in Java and Python, focused on platform engineering, backend systems, distributed architectures, and enterprise integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2137&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a05fe9f68460&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;2+ years of&lt;/strong&gt; hands-on experience with modern front-end frameworks (React, Next.js, TypeScript) to build intuitive developer portals, operator dashboards, and self-service interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2322&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27d4f52a8ffd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deep expertise with&lt;/strong&gt; AWS and event-driven architectures alongside enterprise iPaaS platforms (Zapier, n8n, etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2437&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a785ba61242b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of&lt;/strong&gt; software engineering best practices: &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;IaC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; (Terraform/CloudFormation), CI/CD release automation, API contract design (REST/GraphQL), and unit/integration testing standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2631&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d73f24ffc37f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience in&lt;/strong&gt; platform reliability, central logging, error recovery, operational observability, and self-service governance frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2770&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7a5437c96fa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success in&lt;/strong&gt; building internal platform tools, self-service capabilities, or paved paths that empower and accelerate engineering teams across an enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2941&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4dc92bfbec60&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with&lt;/strong&gt; AI development and integrations, embedding LLM capabilities, agentic primitives, or intelligent features into cloud automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3098&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f0be33504521&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&lt;/strong&gt; AI-driven &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SDLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; practices, leveraging AI-assisted coding tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor) to accelerate software delivery while maintaining safety and quality guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Okta, you’ll join a global Automation Engineering team building secure, enterprise-grade cloud automation and system connectivity. You’ll shape the platform foundations, integration patterns, and self-service capabilities that help teams automate complex workflows at scale. If you’re passionate about building platforms that are &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;scalable, resilient, and secure&lt;/strong&gt;, this is your opportunity to make an impact across Okta.&lt;/p&gt;
