isions and strategy across our marketing channels. You&#39;ll own measurement and analytics for campaigns, partners, and field marketing—including attribution modeling, ROI optimization, and emerging AI capabilities—serving as the go-to analytics expert and thought partner for marketing leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive attribution modeling and full-funnel measurement across all marketing channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data into actionable insights and recommendations for marketing leaders across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create forecasts and scenario models to inform annual budget planning and incremental asks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain self-service dashboards in Tableau for brand, demand gen, digital, and strategic events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Field Analytics, Strategy &amp;amp; Planning, Marketing Leadership, and Data teams on performance narrative and QBRs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Marketing Data Operations team to maintain data quality across martech systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement AI/ML capabilities for predictive modeling and automated insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and support marketing experiments with rigorous testing and statistical validation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide analytical guidance to junior analysts, and establish best practices for the broader analytics function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with analytics tools and methods to drive competitive advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Marketing, Analytics, Operations, or BI in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in marketing analytics: campaign performance, demand gen, field marketing, and ABM measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of using data to drive business strategy and budget decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across enterprise sales, product-led growth, and partner marketing models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in marketing attribution modeling and multi-touch measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data storytelling: communicate complex insights to executives and influence decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of martech infrastructure: database management, data hygiene, API integrations (ad platforms, CRM, analytics tools, data warehouse)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Tableau, Salesforce, Snowflake, Excel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical analysis, A/B testing, and experimental design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and guide the work of others without formal management authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML experience: predictive modeling, propensity scoring, marketing mix modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Analytics (GA4) or Adobe Analytics expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth marketing or demand gen background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Privacy-first measurement, DSPs, programmatic advertising experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python, R, or similar statistical tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced degree (MBA, Analytics, Economics, or related field)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
