&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5291&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c6ddfb78d3f4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Integrate Security by Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Apply and promote security best practices throughout the software development lifecycle for our tooling and infrastructure automation to ensure a secure, compliant operational environment.&lt;/p&gt;
