&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5513&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ae0ea248a263&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Enable Self-Service Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify opportunities to build self-service automation for infrastructure provisioning, application deployments, and other operational tasks, reducing manual effort and improving developer velocity and onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
