&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5777&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6667146fae6b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Provide Technical Guidance and Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a technical mentor and role model for other engineers on the team, fostering a culture of collaboration, innovation, and technical excellence in software engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
