&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6304&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e2c461b1f184&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience in developing and maintaining &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;automation tools, platforms, or microservices&lt;/strong&gt; for cloud environments (AWS, GCP, or similar).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
