&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6454&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bc5753abdc50&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC) principles&lt;/strong&gt; and practical experience with tools such as &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
