&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d4eeb89def25&quot;&gt;Experience with &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;database technologies&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, MongoDB, etc.) in the context of application development and operational management.&lt;/p&gt;
