h People Technology Applications (Workday, Greenhouse, Cornerstone). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As part of our Business Technology team, you will be responsible for developing and optimizing full-stack solutions, including custom scripts, workflows, integrations, and system enhancements for both Workday, Greenhouse and Cornerstone to improve business processes and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role will report to the Manager in Bangalore, India.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design, develop, and maintain full-stack solutions for the People Technology Tech stack like Workday, Greenhouse and Cornerstone Cloud Applications etc., using any of the full-stack applications like &lt;strong&gt;Node Js/React&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain robust off-platform integration scripts using &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;strong&gt;LangChain&lt;/strong&gt; to manage data transfer and interactions between People Technology apps (via API) and AI Platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Architect and implement scalable, secure, and cost-efficient cloud-native solutions on AWS for RAG, MCP, A2A for Agentic AI (LangGraph)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Closely work with the BT Product Manager to design, develop, test, implement &amp;amp; support system solutions primarily in People Technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide technical consultation, best practices, and problem resolution for AI and Agentic AI for the People tech stack Workday Studio / Extend, Cornerstone, Greenhouse, and associated integrated systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work with AI/ML teams and solution architects to integrate AI capabilities into enterprise applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support &amp;amp; resolve production issues across the full application stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain integrations with third-party applications via REST/SOAP APIs, Agent to Agent (A2A) and MCP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design and implement custom Generative AI solutions using the Workday Agent System of Record &lt;strong&gt;Agent Tools&lt;/strong&gt; for practical Workday use cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;9+ years in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and its libraries (e.g., Pandas, Boto3) for data manipulation, ETL processes, and developing serverless functions to interact with foundational AI services on platforms like &lt;strong&gt;AWS Bedrock&lt;/strong&gt; or OpenAI or equivalent platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;6+ years with modern front-end frameworks (e.g., React, Next.js, TypeScript, Python), and an ability to collaborate effectively with Product &amp;amp; Design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Deep hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;AWS solutioning&lt;/strong&gt;, including designing and deploying production applications using core services such as &lt;strong&gt;AWS EC2, AWS Lambda, Amazon S3, Amazon RDS, and API Gateway&lt;/strong&gt;. Familiarity with Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tools like CloudFormation or Terraform is essential.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proven experience building and deploying production-grade AI applications and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with agentic frameworks like LangChain, LangGraph, and LangSmith is a strong plus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And extra credit if you have experience in any of the following&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
