&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, or equivalent years of industry experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
