&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":44028,"name":"SW Eng - Applications-674","child_ids":[],"parent_id":396304}],"offices":[{"id":19614,"name":"Toronto","location":"Toronto, ON, Canada","child_ids":[],"parent_id":67251}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8258803?gh_jid=8258803","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3573615,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, India"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8258803,"updated_at":"2026-10-07T01:50:03-04:00","requisition_id":"P17928_3573615","title":"Staff Software Engineer, Platform & Infrastructure","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-10-07T01:50:03-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer, Platform &amp;amp; Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tagline:&lt;/strong&gt; Build the engine that builds Okta.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Your Mission: Define the Future of Developer Velocity at Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a software engineer who believes that an exceptional developer platform is the key to unlocking engineering-wide innovation? Are you obsessed with building the high-leverage tools, services, and automated infrastructure that make building, testing, and deploying software a seamless experience?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt; team is the central nervous system for all of Okta Engineering. We build and own the entire internal developer platform—the CI/CD pipelines, the build-and-test orchestration, and the multi-cloud infrastructure that powers it all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just about maintaining systems. It&#39;s about building a scalable, resilient, and blazing-fast &quot;paved road&quot; that empowers hundreds of engineers to ship high-quality code, multiple times a day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our scale is immense. We run &lt;strong&gt;tens of thousands of automated tests for every single commit&lt;/strong&gt;. As Okta grows, this CI/CD workload presents a monumental engineering challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary goal will be to attack this problem head-on. You will be a key builder&amp;nbsp; in our quest to shrink massive, distributed compute jobs &lt;strong&gt;from hours or days down to just minutes&lt;/strong&gt;. This role requires deep systems thinking, clever orchestration, and a passion for wringing every last drop of performance out of the infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💻 What You&#39;ll Do (The Impact)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer, you are a technical leader, architect, and hands-on builder. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, code, and operate the next generation of our CI/CD platform, primarily using &lt;strong&gt;Go (Golang) and Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Kubernetes:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage your deep &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes (K8s)&lt;/strong&gt; expertise to orchestrate our complex and ephemeral build, test, and deployment workflows at massive scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Multi-Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; Build services and automation that abstract and manage workloads &lt;strong&gt;extensively across AWS, GCP, and Azure&lt;/strong&gt;, optimizing for cost, speed, and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a Platform, Not Just Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Create robust, self-service, and elegant internal products for our engineers. You&#39;ll treat our internal developers as your first-class customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; You will not just &lt;em&gt;use&lt;/em&gt; our build and CI systems, you will be responsible for &lt;em&gt;building and scaling&lt;/em&gt; them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; Lead:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with peers, mentor other engineers, and set the technical direction for major platform initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅ What You&#39;ll Bring (The Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a seasoned engineer who has built and scaled internal platforms before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience in Software Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coding Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a strong software engineer first, with proven experience building and maintaining complex systems in &lt;strong&gt;Go (Golang)&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes is a Must:&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep, practical experience building, running, and troubleshooting workloads on Kubernetes. You understand pods, operators, scheduling, and networking inside and out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD as a Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; You have architected, built, and/or significantly scaled CI/CD pipelines (e.g., Jenkins, GitLab, Tekton, ArgoCD) as a &lt;em&gt;platform&lt;/em&gt; for other engineers, not just as an end-user.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; You have demonstrable experience working in major cloud providers (AWS, GCP, Azure) and understand the nuances of their core services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Platform Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re fluent in the tools of the trade: &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;, container registries (like Artifactory), and modern build systems (like &lt;strong&gt;Gradle&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Bazel&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You are customer-obsessed (your customers are other engineers) and have a proven ability to lead complex, cross-functional projects to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; B.S. in Computer Science, equivalent technical experience, or just a proven track record of shipping incredible systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L1-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P17928_3573615&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":44029,"name":"SW - Engineering Services-676","child_ids":[],"parent_id":396304}],"offices":[{"id":89126,"name":"Bengaluru ","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":89122}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8053763?gh_jid=8053763","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3490564,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, India"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8053763,"updated_at":"2026-09-25T06:23:08-04:00","requisition_id":"P10454_3490564","title":"Staff Software Engineer-Salesforce","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-09-12T05:33:33-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to know Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Okta is The World’s Identity Company. We free everyone to safely use any technology anywhere, on any device or app. Our Workforce and Customer Identity Clouds enable secure yet flexible access, authentication, and automation that transforms how people move through the digital world, putting Identity at the heart of business security and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Okta, we celebrate a variety of perspectives and experiences. We are not looking for someone who checks every single box we’re looking for lifelong learners and people who can make us better with their unique experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our team! We’re building a world where Identity belongs to you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Technology Data and Intelligence at Okta&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Okta, the Technology Data and Intelligence (TDI) team drives internal efficiency through secure, scalable, and innovative systems. TDI partners with teams across the company to build and support the infrastructure, automation, and enterprise applications that keep operations running smoothly. Focused on enabling productivity and aligning technology with business goals, TDI plays a vital role in both day-to-day operations and long-term strategic growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Staff Software Engineer Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team in TDI and help scale our internal business solutions with a sharp focus on security, reliability, scalability, and intelligent automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for designing and developing customizations, configurations, integrations, and AI-powered solutions required to meet the company’s strategic business objectives. This role demands strong collaboration with business stakeholders, analysts, architects, and engineers, driving projects from ideation to production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Manager of Customer Experience, TDI, this role provides end-to-end technical services including design, configuration, development, testing, and automation while delivering high-quality, secure, and future-ready solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design and implement secure, scalable solutions using Apex, Lightning Web Components (LWC), Salesforce Flow, and platform configuration tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Translate business requirements into technical specifications and solution designs leveraging the Salesforce platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build and maintain integrations between Salesforce and external systems using REST/SOAP APIs, middleware, and event-driven patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and deploy serverless solutions using Amazon Web Services Lambda and cloud-native services to extend Salesforce capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build intelligent automation solutions using Python and AI frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, and Amazon Bedrock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design conversational workflows, internal copilots, or AI agents that improve employee productivity and customer support operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work collaboratively with cross-functional teams to align solutions with business goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide level-of-effort estimates and feasibility assessments for proposed solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop Salesforce features across multiple clouds (Sales Cloud, Service Cloud Console, Experience Cloud).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Own the full delivery lifecycle from discovery to deployment with proper documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Create and execute unit, integration, functional, and automation test cases to ensure solution quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support production deployments and perform root-cause analysis of issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mentor other engineers to help them grow and improve their skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Take the role of Delivery Lead for different projects, making sure the team delivers the solution within the committed timelines while also follows defined coding/implementation best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years of hands-on Salesforce development experience using Apex, Process Automation tools, and Lightning Web Components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;7+ years of software development experience using Java, Python, or JavaScript.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with Salesforce products such as Sales Cloud, Service Cloud, Experience Cloud, and Communities with an in-depth understanding of best practices, coding, and declarative frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong Python development experience for automation, integrations, and AI/ML workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience designing cloud-native solutions using Amazon Web Services services such as Lambda, API Gateway, SQS, Step Functions, or serverless architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with Generative AI / LLM frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, or Amazon Bedrock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with source control and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to manage and deliver full lifecycle Salesforce projects independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of developing secure solutions that protect sensitive data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong problem-solving, debugging, and communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Extra Credit if You Have Experience in Any of the Following!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Salesforce certifications (Platform Developer I/II, Service Cloud Consultant, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with Einstein Bots, predictive analytics, Agentforce, or other AI-powered Salesforce tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with DevOps tools and CI/CD practices for Salesforce.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
