&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of prompt engineering, vector databases, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), or AI governance practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
