&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Background in high-growth, fast-paced technology companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
