&lt;p&gt;This role is for the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/customer-identity/&quot;&gt;Customer Identity Cloud&lt;/a&gt; product unit and you’ll be supporting CIC customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
