&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":28487,"name":"Enterprise Sales-340","child_ids":[],"parent_id":29631}],"offices":[{"id":21497,"name":"US Remote East Coast","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":67252}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8175690?gh_jid=8175690","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3538270,"location":{"name":"Bellevue, Washington; Chicago, Illinois; New York, New York; Washington, DC"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8175690,"updated_at":"2026-10-14T18:45:59-04:00","requisition_id":"P-2372_3538270","title":"Vice President, Vertical Strategy & Commercialization","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-10-14T18:45:59-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Auth0 is seeking an entrepreneurial leader to drive the commercial and go-to-market (GTM) success of our upmarket vertical motion. Operating in a strategic partnership model alongside the Chief Product Architect you will be the commercial engine bridging our product capabilities with specialized market needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting within the Auth0 Product organization, reporting to the CPO, you will be responsible for defining our vertical market strategy, and ensuring these solutions land successfully in the market. You will partner across Okta to shape everything from customer segmentation, pricing, and packaging to field enablement and strategic partnerships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a 0 to 1 builder, you will act as a highly leveraged executive with the opportunity to expand this mandate across multiple verticals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vertical Strategy &amp;amp; Commercialization:&lt;/strong&gt; Devise the end-to-end go-to-market strategy for our upmarket motion, driving customer segmentation, targeting, and the commercial structure (pricing, packaging, and positioning) of vertical-specific offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner deeply with Marketing, Product Marketing (PMM), and the field to develop robust enablement programs that support Sales, Professional Services, Support and Channel Partners to successfully position and deploy Auth0 in support of up-market vertical expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of the market, translating deep vertical insights and business requirements into actionable product requirements for the Chief Product Architect and supporting teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Structuring:&lt;/strong&gt; Work hands-on in both pre- and post-sales cycles alongside the field to structure complex, outcome-aligned solutions for strategic enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem &amp;amp; Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with the Tech Partnerships team and Global System Integrators (GSIs) to build scalable, repeatable programs that accelerate vertical adoption and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Expand:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate with an entrepreneurial mindset to prove the model in initial verticals (Retail/Commerce) before expanding the mandate and scaling a team to support multiple industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage 12+ years of enterprise software leadership and deep domain expertise in Retail, Commerce, and adjacent verticals to spearhead 0-to-1 verticalization strategies, driving ARR growth by aligning identity, cybersecurity, and data-driven solutions with complex customer business outcomes while building trusted executive-level relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Vertical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Extensive experience in Retail and Commerce (or a direct adjacency like Travel &amp;amp; Hospitality), with expertise including customer acquisition and conversion, risk and fraud prevention, customer 360 and data programs, third-party integrations, and the evolving regional and industry specific regulations that impact global leaders in Retail, Commerce and adjacent verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to build deep, trusted relationships across both business and technical stakeholders at the executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the technology, business, and operational challenges associated with digital experiences (both e-commerce and physical retail). You understand how identity, data and security act as critical enablers of modern growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial Builder:&lt;/strong&gt; A 0 to 1 operator who thrives in ambiguity, capable of rolling up their sleeves to execute initiatives independently while laying the groundwork to scale a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong background in product monetization, GTM strategy, solution structuring, and field enablement. You know how to align product capabilities with customer business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt; A background in cybersecurity, IAM (Identity and Access Management), or enterprise software infrastructure is highly preferred.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;br&gt;#PID: P-2372_3538270&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Below is the annual base salary range for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York and Washington. Your actual base salary will depend on factors such as your skills, qualifications, experience, and work location. In addition, Okta offers equity (where applicable), bonus, and benefits, including health, dental and vision insurance, 401(k), flexible spending account, and paid leave (including PTO and parental leave) in accordance with our applicable plans and policies. To learn more about our Total Rewards program please visit:&lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.okta.com/us&quot;&gt; https://rewards.okta.com/us&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual base salary range for this position for candidates located in California (excluding San Francisco Bay Area), Colorado, Illinois, New York, and Washington is between:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$294,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$403,700 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":28480,"name":"Product Management-810","child_ids":[],"parent_id":396304}],"offices":[{"id":85788,"name":"New York","location":"New York, New York, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":67252}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.okta.com/company/careers/opportunity/8195169?gh_jid=8195169","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":3546732,"location":{"name":"Bengaluru, India"},"metadata":[{"id":58735330,"name":"Naukri Job URL","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735350,"name":"Naukri Job Error","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"},{"id":58735367,"name":"Minimum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735368,"name":"Maximum Salary","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735369,"name":"Minimum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735370,"name":"Maximum Work Experience","value":null,"value_type":"number"},{"id":58735384,"name":"City","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":58735385,"name":"Job Description","value":null,"value_type":"long_text"}],"id":8195169,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T12:33:18-04:00","requisition_id":"P25736_3546732","title":"Workday Extend Developer ","company_name":"Okta","first_published":"2026-09-11T06:42:02-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Okta is seeking a&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Staff Application Developer – People Technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our Business Solutions Team. In this critical role, you will partner closely with the People Technology leadership and play a key role in our Workday transformation efforts. As part of a cross-functional team, you will collaborate with stakeholders across People, Payroll, IT, Finance, and international offices to optimize and scale our HR systems and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who is passionate about solving complex business challenges, driving innovation through automation, and delivering a best-in-class user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end architecture and technical design&lt;/strong&gt; of Workday Extend applications, integrations, and supporting technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define scalable, secure, resilient, and maintainable &lt;strong&gt;application architecture, integration architecture, data flows, API strategies, and technical standards&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and lead the development of complex &lt;strong&gt;Workday Extend applications&lt;/strong&gt; using TypeScript/JavaScript, Workday APIs, and Extend frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect enterprise Workday integrations using &lt;strong&gt;Workday Studio, EIB, Core Connectors, RaaS, REST APIs, SOAP Web Services, and Workday Web Services&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate business requirements and determine the appropriate solution across &lt;strong&gt;Workday configuration, Extend, integrations, APIs, AI, cloud services, and third-party platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish architectural patterns and reusable frameworks for Workday Extend applications and integrations to support scalability, extensibility, security, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership for the complete application lifecycle, including &lt;strong&gt;architecture, design, development, testing, deployment, release management, and production support&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop solutions that leverage &lt;strong&gt;AI and Generative AI&lt;/strong&gt; to enable intelligent automation, enhanced user experiences, decision support, and innovative business capabilities within the Workday ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess and utilize &lt;strong&gt;AWS cloud services&lt;/strong&gt; where required to support application components, APIs, integrations, data processing, AI capabilities, and enterprise workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and govern &lt;strong&gt;API, integration, security, authentication, authorization, error-handling, monitoring, logging, and performance&lt;/strong&gt; strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with enterprise architects, business stakeholders, functional leads, security teams, cloud teams, and engineering teams to ensure solutions align with enterprise technology standards and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discovery, architecture workshops, proof-of-concepts, technology evaluations, and solution estimations for complex business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve technical designs, application architecture, integration patterns, and development approaches to ensure adherence to architectural standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks, dependencies, scalability concerns, and opportunities for modernization, and define appropriate mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on technical guidance when required while &lt;strong&gt;leading and mentoring senior developers and engineering teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish development and engineering best practices, including code quality, version control, CI/CD, testing, observability, documentation, and deployment standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement of the Workday technical landscape by evaluating new capabilities across &lt;strong&gt;Workday Extend, Workday Integration, Orchestrate, AI/GenAI, AWS, APIs, and emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8 to 10 years of overall IT/software development experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4+ years of hands-on Workday Extend experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workday certification in Extend&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Workday Integration Frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Workday Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with EIB, Core Connectors, Cloud Connect, and Workday Web Services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Workday REST/SOAP APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with RaaS, Workday Reports, Calculated Fields, and Business Processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Workday HCM architecture and Workday data model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and developing enterprise-grade integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AWS cloud services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to AI/ML and Generative AI technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of API-based and event-driven integration architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, analytical, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating LLM/GenAI APIs into enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AWS Bedrock or equivalent enterprise AI services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS Lambda, API Gateway, S3, IAM, CloudWatch, EventBridge, or similar AWS services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of RAG, embeddings, vector databases, prompt engineering, and AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-powered automation or employee-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to CI/CD, DevOps, Git, automated testing, and cloud deployment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
